{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras/84ff2edab3e42fc219457bc83e37572e.avif?t=1766665828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras_big/84ff2edab3e42fc219457bc83e37572e.webp?t=1766665828 width=1560 height=93 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is about a computer programmer by day, hacker by night. He embarks on a dystopian adventure, investigating a failing enterprise in a world dominated by mega-corporations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cyberphobia</strong>, a conspiracy festers in the digital shadows, and you are the rogue hacker high-tech enough to expose it. Dive into a gritty cyberpunk thriller that merges intense first-person shooting with a deep, branching narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-driven FPS where your decisions matter. Navigate a dynamic world across distinct levels, confronting a large roster of enemies from multiple factions. Every moral choice you make will have an impact, shaping your journey to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras/971570cf0d7e76e28403b12d440b75b2.avif?t=1766665828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras_big/971570cf0d7e76e28403b12d440b75b2.webp?t=1766665828 width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense FPS Combat:</strong> Wield a diverse arsenal of weapons in a rich, narrative-driven campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impactful Moral Choices:</strong> Make difficult decisions that alter the story and your place in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep RPG Progression:</strong> Evolve your character's skills and abilities to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Manage:</strong> Scavenge for valuable loot, build new gear, and organize it all in a classic grid-based inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Conspiracy:</strong> Hunt for collectibles and lore-rich documents to piece together the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A City of Enemies:</strong> Navigate a dynamic world filled with distinct levels, multiple factions, and a large roster of deadly foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras/b6f24016ac507bd371eab649db626c52.avif?t=1766665828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras_big/b6f24016ac507bd371eab649db626c52.webp?t=1766665828 width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cyberphobia: Prologue</strong>, every decision you make in and out of combat feeds into a layered progression and gear system designed for tinkerers, min-maxers, and lore hunters alike. More features will be released in upcoming game updates.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Clocked Out","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127140/194fb40d09fab6c111169ba77fb5eab1f0aa2641.jpg"},{"name":"Patient Discharge","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127140/a18573e563a4b3a7b1896d8dff4f6a394d66a63e.jpg"},{"name":"Wrong Turn","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127140/1d807619ba3d026b1dc72d447a2aff2290d6f1e9.jpg"},{"name":"Mind the Gap","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127140/69f0bf2781b6f1caa615818df79ecd1c19a3d69b.jpg"},{"name":"Through the Mist","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127140/09caaeb7b532405a35c041b7e1bd2ac0a65e89f8.jpg"},{"name":"Blind Alley","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127140/dcbdd586bf5c75297eb84ee9ef1bc7f78353ff2b.jpg"},{"name":"Safe and Sound?","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/4127140/b18aeef2fe0fdf9ce422bfb4ecd6643904245cde.jpg"}],"total":7},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127140?t=1766665828","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4127140?t=1766665828","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/254d95495f11577f1a4b057c32f424d3cab3af2a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1766665828","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/254d95495f11577f1a4b057c32f424d3cab3af2a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1766665828","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"This game is a mature, extremely graphic game containing frequent intense violence, gore, adult themes, frightening psychological horror, and general mature content, including non-graphic cartoon/fantasy violence and derogatory language."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras/84ff2edab3e42fc219457bc83e37572e.avif?t=1766665828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras_big/84ff2edab3e42fc219457bc83e37572e.webp?t=1766665828 width=1560 height=93 /></span>  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The story is about a computer programmer by day, hacker by night. He embarks on a dystopian adventure, investigating a failing enterprise in a world dominated by mega-corporations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cyberphobia</strong>, a conspiracy festers in the digital shadows, and you are the rogue hacker high-tech enough to expose it. Dive into a gritty cyberpunk thriller that merges intense first-person shooting with a deep, branching narrative.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a story-driven FPS where your decisions matter. Navigate a dynamic world across distinct levels, confronting a large roster of enemies from multiple factions. Every moral choice you make will have an impact, shaping your journey to uncover the truth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras/971570cf0d7e76e28403b12d440b75b2.avif?t=1766665828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras_big/971570cf0d7e76e28403b12d440b75b2.webp?t=1766665828 width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >KEY FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Intense FPS Combat:</strong> Wield a diverse arsenal of weapons in a rich, narrative-driven campaign.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Impactful Moral Choices:</strong> Make difficult decisions that alter the story and your place in the world.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Deep RPG Progression:</strong> Evolve your character's skills and abilities to match your playstyle.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot &amp; Manage:</strong> Scavenge for valuable loot, build new gear, and organize it all in a classic grid-based inventory.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Uncover the Conspiracy:</strong> Hunt for collectibles and lore-rich documents to piece together the truth.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A City of Enemies:</strong> Navigate a dynamic world filled with distinct levels, multiple factions, and a large roster of deadly foes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras/b6f24016ac507bd371eab649db626c52.avif?t=1766665828\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/extras_big/b6f24016ac507bd371eab649db626c52.webp?t=1766665828 width=1560 height=93 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In <strong>Cyberphobia: Prologue</strong>, every decision you make in and out of combat feeds into a layered progression and gear system designed for tinkerers, min-maxers, and lore hunters alike. More features will be released in upcoming game updates.</p>","developers":["PHANTOM PRODUCTIONS YAZILIM LIMITED"],"dlc":[4184950,4184960,4184970,4186240,4186250,4245780,4253270],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4127140/7f421c90bc04fadc369671e982ebbb3278853cd7/header.jpg?t=1766665828","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Linux Distribution (e.g., Ubuntu, Fedora, Manjaro, SteamOS 3.0+) with Vulkan support<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i3-8100 or newer, 4 cores / Ryzen 3 1200 or newer, 4 cores<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> GTX 750 Ti (Must support Vulkan) / RX 560 or similar (Must support Vulkan)<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 10 GB available space</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"b